The dream skill (skills/dream/SKILL.md) adapts the workflow of dream-skill by
timoncool, https://github.com/timoncool/dream-skill: the read, reflect and
propose phases, the notes log, the evidence policy for stale entries, the rule
against history in memory text, and the memory frontmatter types. dreamkit
rewrites it to read transcripts and to end as a pull request instead of an HTML
checklist. No code was copied. dream-skill is under this licence:

